Scope note

This licence covers the source code and documentation in this repository.

It does not, and cannot, grant any right over third-party scholarly full
texts. No publisher full text is redistributed here: DOIs/DOIs.txt contains
persistent identifiers only, and scripts/fetch_fulltext.py retrieves full
text at run time under the user's own text-mining agreement with each
publisher.

The MatProGPT database itself is deposited separately and is licensed
CC-BY-4.0: https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.23862298

